mbox-notice\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/60px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/120px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>可參照<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakfast_cereal\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Breakfast cereal\">英語維基百科</a>相應條目來擴充</b>。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span> <small class=\"date-container\"><i>(<span class=\"date\">2024年11月25日</span>)</i></small><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>若您熟悉來源語言和主題，請協助<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%88%E5%88%99\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:翻譯守則\">參考外語維基百科擴充條目</a>。請勿直接提交機械翻譯，也不要翻譯不可靠、低品質內容。依<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%9C%A8%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E5%86%85%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9\" title=\"Wikipedia:在維基百科內複製內容\">版權協議</a>，譯文需<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81#翻譯文章\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:編輯摘要\">在編輯摘要註明來源</a>，或於討論頁頂部標記<code>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Translated_page\" title=\"Template:Translated page\">Translated page</a>}}</code>標籤。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"noteTA-91ce81bb\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-group\"><div data-noteta-group-source=\"module\" data-noteta-group=\"Food\"></div></div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Breakfast_of_Champions.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Breakfast_of_Champions.jpg/250px-Breakfast_of_Champions.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"189\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Breakfast_of_Champions.jpg/500px-Breakfast_of_Champions.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2082\" data-file-height=\"1575\" /></a><figcaption>一碗配著牛奶的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E7%B1%B3%E7%89%87\" title=\"玉米片\">玉米片</a>。</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>穀物片</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">breakfast cereal</span>），簡稱<b>穀</b>/<b>麥片</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">cereal</span>），是一種由加工穀物製成的<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"食品\">食品</a>，並在某些<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96\" title=\"飲食文化\">飲食文化</a>中為<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A9%E9%A4%90\" title=\"早餐\">早餐</a>通常的一部分。該食品經常被與<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"水果\">水果</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9E%9C%E6%B1%81\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"果汁\">果汁</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%84%AA%E6%A0%BC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"優格\">優格</a>及<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%9B%E5%A5%B6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"牛奶\">牛奶</a>混和食用。其常見種類有<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%A8%E6%96%AF%E9%87%8C\" title=\"木斯里\">木斯里</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E7%B1%B3%E7%89%87\" title=\"玉米片\">玉米片</a>等。此外，世界各地多種營養麥片都有添加維他命等<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E7%B4%A0\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"營養素\">營養素</a>。現今，<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%9A\" title=\"食品產業\">食品業界</a>製造了大量含有高量<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E5%88%86\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"糖分\">糖分</a>的麥片。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"相關條目\"><span id=\".E7.9B.B8.E9.97.9C.E6.A2.9D.E7.9B.AE\"></span>相關條目</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%A9%80%E7%89%A9%E7%89%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：相關條目\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E7%B1%B3%E7%89%87\" title=\"玉米片\">玉米片</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%87%95%E9%BA%A5%E7%89%87\" title=\"燕麥片\">燕麥片</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考來源\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E4.BE.86.E6.BA.90\"></span>參考來源</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%A9%80%E7%89%A9%E7%89%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：參考來源\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist reflist-columns\" style=\"column-count: 2;\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;n